Task Summary: Implement AudioManager (TDD Green Phase)

=== Task ===
Implement the AudioManager class for SFX playback, BGM loop, BGM/SFX toggle management, and Web Audio API frog note synthesis.

=== Files Changed ===
- Created: src/audio/AudioManager.ts (140 lines) — AudioManager class with SfxName type export
- Modified: src/__tests__/audio/AudioManager.test.ts — Fixed constructor mocks to use function expressions instead of arrow functions (arrow functions cannot be used with new)

=== Implementation Details ===
1. SFX playback: HTML5 Audio elements created for 6 sounds (pop, correct, incorrect, wake, win, sticker) with currentTime reset before each play
2. BGM loop: Single HTML5 Audio element with loop=true
3. BGM/SFX toggle: Reads settings via getSettings() on init, writes via updateSettings() on toggle. BGM auto-pauses when disabled.
4. Web Audio API synthesis: Sine wave oscillator with configurable frequency, gain node for volume control, 0.5s duration
5. Settings integration: Uses real storage utils (getSettings, updateSettings) for localStorage persistence
6. Cleanup: destroy() closes AudioContext, pauses BGM, clears references

=== Key Design Decisions ===
- SfxName type derived from const array: type SfxName = (typeof SFX_NAMES)[number]
- SFX audio paths: /audio/{name}.mp3 (assumes files in public/audio/)
- BGM path: /audio/bgm.mp3
- Frog note gain: 0.3 (comfortable volume per product guidelines)
- Frog note duration: 0.5s (within 1-2s max SFX duration per product guidelines)
- Oscillator type: sine (warm tone per product guidelines)

=== Mock Fix ===
Initial test used arrow functions in vi.fn() for AudioContext and Audio constructor mocks. Arrow functions cannot be used as constructors with 'new', causing 'TypeError: () => mockAudioContext is not a constructor'. Fixed by using regular function expressions with biome-ignore comments.

